1
00:00:12,240 --> 00:00:13,240
Wangshu!

2
00:00:16,079 --> 00:00:17,079
Wangshu!

3
00:00:17,760 --> 00:00:18,760
Xingyao!

4
00:00:19,719 --> 00:00:21,440
Please, just let me through!

5
00:00:21,760 --> 00:00:22,920
I'm begging you!

6
00:00:23,359 --> 00:00:24,359
Wangshu!

7
00:00:24,640 --> 00:00:25,719
Let go of my sister!

8
00:00:26,440 --> 00:00:27,440
Yue Xingyao,

9
00:00:27,760 --> 00:00:29,440
how dare you try to escape

10
00:00:29,879 --> 00:00:31,519
and disrupt the sacred ritual!

11
00:00:35,280 --> 00:00:37,119
I am a princess by His Majesty's decree,

12
00:00:37,417 --> 00:00:39,020
and a consort chosen by the Loong Lord!

13
00:00:39,479 --> 00:00:40,960
I dare any of you to touch her!

14
00:00:45,240 --> 00:00:46,240
Wangshu!

15
00:00:47,640 --> 00:00:48,640
Wangshu.

16
00:00:49,079 --> 00:00:50,439
After the ritual, Jiang Liuying

17
00:00:51,321 --> 00:00:53,523
will marry you to Zhang Jin,
the Prefect's second son.

18
00:00:53,799 --> 00:00:55,119
He's a notorious playboy.

19
00:00:55,330 --> 00:00:56,330
Remember.

20
00:00:57,114 --> 00:00:58,799
Slip away
during the chaos of the ritual.

21
00:00:59,200 --> 00:01:00,600
Run as far as you can.

22
00:01:07,760 --> 00:01:09,079
I'll wait for your return.

23
00:01:20,616 --> 00:01:26,437
=My Loong=

24
00:01:26,437 --> 00:01:28,991
=Episode 3=

25
00:01:32,239 --> 00:01:33,640
I don't know why,

26
00:01:35,239 --> 00:01:36,280
but whenever I'm hurt,

27
00:01:37,719 --> 00:01:39,799
you seem to feel the exact same pain.

28
00:01:48,319 --> 00:01:49,319
Let me go.

29
00:02:39,879 --> 00:02:42,240
My leg doesn't hurt anymore.

30
00:02:46,080 --> 00:02:47,080
You...

31
00:02:47,599 --> 00:02:49,879
You took my injuries onto yourself?

32
00:02:54,280 --> 00:02:57,319
Then my injuries before were also...

33
00:02:57,319 --> 00:02:58,319
Yes.

34
00:02:58,759 --> 00:03:00,879
I intended to find you healing herbs.

35
00:03:03,599 --> 00:03:04,599
But I found none.

36
00:03:04,759 --> 00:03:06,080
And you wouldn't stop whining.

37
00:03:07,560 --> 00:03:08,560
So I did that instead.

38
00:03:18,840 --> 00:03:20,199
Are you unable to move?

39
00:03:20,719 --> 00:03:21,719
Leave.

40
00:03:25,240 --> 00:03:26,240
You're letting me go?

41
00:03:26,680 --> 00:03:27,680
Yes.

42
00:03:27,719 --> 00:03:28,719
You showed me affection.

43
00:03:28,840 --> 00:03:29,840
Then you attacked me.

44
00:03:30,280 --> 00:03:31,280
First you ran.

45
00:03:31,280 --> 00:03:32,759
Then you threatened to die.

46
00:03:33,240 --> 00:03:34,360
You are too troublesome.

47
00:03:35,199 --> 00:03:36,199
Get lost.

48
00:03:44,280 --> 00:03:45,599
Get lost!

49
00:03:47,479 --> 00:03:48,479
Stop bothering me.

50
00:04:19,000 --> 00:04:21,560
Still not leaving? Get lost!

51
00:04:28,000 --> 00:04:29,560
(Even if I go back alone now,)

52
00:04:30,720 --> 00:04:32,040
(facing spineless Zhu Heng)

53
00:04:32,639 --> 00:04:34,099
(and my ruthless family,)

54
00:04:34,569 --> 00:04:36,279
(I won't survive anyway,)

55
00:04:36,680 --> 00:04:38,040
(much less protect Xingyao.)

56
00:04:46,560 --> 00:04:47,560
(He's a loong.)

57
00:04:48,050 --> 00:04:49,332
(He knows no human deceit)

58
00:04:49,535 --> 00:04:50,639
(and scorns worldly rules,)

59
00:04:51,480 --> 00:04:53,040
(yet he drove away beasts for me)

60
00:04:53,319 --> 00:04:54,319
(and took away my pain.)

61
00:05:00,404 --> 00:05:01,404
(I...)

62
00:05:02,467 --> 00:05:03,667
(have to take this gamble.)

63
00:05:06,920 --> 00:05:09,000
That day, and every time since,

64
00:05:10,079 --> 00:05:11,079
you've been protecting me

65
00:05:11,079 --> 00:05:12,279
and healing me, haven't you?

66
00:05:17,920 --> 00:05:19,439
Your wounds were caused by me.

67
00:05:20,839 --> 00:05:21,920
I shouldn't just walk away.

68
00:05:22,839 --> 00:05:23,839
I'll help you heal.

69
00:05:27,240 --> 00:05:28,680
I just found you annoying.

70
00:05:29,279 --> 00:05:30,680
You don't need to feel guilty.

71
00:05:31,240 --> 00:05:32,279
Humans are treacherous.

72
00:05:33,120 --> 00:05:35,720
I want nothing more to do with humans.

73
00:05:36,279 --> 00:05:37,279
True.

74
00:05:37,279 --> 00:05:38,279
Humans are treacherous.

75
00:05:39,000 --> 00:05:41,040
But I always settle my debts.

76
00:05:41,360 --> 00:05:42,360
You took my pain,

77
00:05:42,399 --> 00:05:43,439
so I will repay you.

78
00:05:48,079 --> 00:05:51,519
What? Is the mighty Loong Lord
afraid of a weak girl like me?

79
00:06:14,720 --> 00:06:15,720
Do you have

80
00:06:17,079 --> 00:06:18,600
any clothes here I could wear?

81
00:06:30,959 --> 00:06:32,160
(This scent...)

82
00:06:32,160 --> 00:06:33,360
(An aphrodisiac blend?)

83
00:06:35,519 --> 00:06:37,800
(So that was why...)

84
00:06:39,199 --> 00:06:40,199
What is this?

85
00:06:40,639 --> 00:06:41,639
Nothing.

86
00:06:43,240 --> 00:06:45,160
It's empty. You can't eat it.

87
00:06:48,120 --> 00:06:50,279
Do they send many offerings like this

88
00:06:51,160 --> 00:06:53,319
down every year for the ritual?

89
00:06:54,560 --> 00:06:55,680
Do you know where they are?

90
00:06:58,439 --> 00:07:00,439
Lanyuan put them here
because they took up space.

91
00:07:37,360 --> 00:07:38,360
Eat.

92
00:07:43,959 --> 00:07:44,959
It's delicious.

93
00:07:48,319 --> 00:07:49,319
So good.

94
00:08:06,560 --> 00:08:10,040
(Loongs aren't quite what I imagined.)

95
00:08:10,620 --> 00:08:13,861
♪The mountain moon hangs
pure and bright♪

96
00:08:14,130 --> 00:08:17,285
♪Cool breeze rustles leaves
against red tiles♪

97
00:08:17,690 --> 00:08:20,499
♪Shadows paired
beneath the western window♪

98
00:08:20,499 --> 00:08:23,916
♪I play chess with you by candlelight♪

99
00:08:24,723 --> 00:08:28,282
♪The mortal world is loud and restless♪

100
00:08:28,282 --> 00:08:33,172
♪A grand realm
masked by deceit and strife♪

101
00:08:33,172 --> 00:08:35,741
♪Golden robes and spirited steeds♪

102
00:08:36,253 --> 00:08:41,135
♪Vanish like mirages in the desert sand♪

103
00:08:42,092 --> 00:08:45,673
♪We listen to the night rain,
sharing wine over quiet talk♪

104
00:08:45,673 --> 00:08:48,252
♪Will swallows return to the branches♪

105
00:08:48,252 --> 00:08:50,717
♪At my home tomorrow♪

106
00:08:51,044 --> 00:08:52,706
♪To grow old together as one♪

107
00:08:52,706 --> 00:08:56,278
♪No need to seek a distant paradise♪

108
00:08:56,278 --> 00:08:59,590
♪Grace and youth shine across your brow♪

109
00:08:59,590 --> 00:09:01,977
♪Who would crave any other waters♪

110
00:09:02,382 --> 00:09:04,868
♪When everything else
drifts like clouds♪

111
00:09:04,868 --> 00:09:06,772
♪By your side for this lifetime♪

112
00:09:06,772 --> 00:09:12,713
♪I watch sunsets
through the turning seasons♪

113
00:09:54,320 --> 00:09:56,840
This is the flower
I read about in storybooks,

114
00:09:57,399 --> 00:09:58,399
the Haichen Bloom.

115
00:10:01,080 --> 00:10:02,440
Why did you bring me here?

116
00:10:16,399 --> 00:10:17,438
The Haichen Bloom...

117
00:10:18,956 --> 00:10:20,080
It should help.

118
00:10:25,080 --> 00:10:26,080
Let me try it.

119
00:10:42,120 --> 00:10:43,120
It actually works.

120
00:10:45,679 --> 00:10:46,679
Little one.

121
00:10:54,600 --> 00:10:56,320
You... You're awake?

122
00:10:57,480 --> 00:10:58,759
I went to fetch you some water,

123
00:10:59,000 --> 00:11:00,000
and then...

124
00:11:18,120 --> 00:11:19,399
(Even they are afraid of him.)

125
00:11:19,960 --> 00:11:21,200
(It must be the Li Fire.)

126
00:11:21,559 --> 00:11:23,159
(It's why the flowers withered too.)

127
00:11:31,759 --> 00:11:32,759
It's Haichen Bloom.

128
00:11:33,399 --> 00:11:35,279
I thought it might help,
so I picked some.

129
00:11:55,960 --> 00:11:58,559
So the storybooks
in the mortal realm say

130
00:11:59,759 --> 00:12:01,480
the Loong Lord bears a fire tribulation,

131
00:12:01,799 --> 00:12:02,879
burning heart and bone,

132
00:12:04,039 --> 00:12:05,039
impossible to control,

133
00:12:05,840 --> 00:12:07,080
and that is why he's trapped.

134
00:12:08,240 --> 00:12:09,600
So it is all true?

135
00:12:11,600 --> 00:12:13,039
So the Haichen Blooms withered

136
00:12:13,879 --> 00:12:15,120
due to your fire tribulation?

137
00:12:17,159 --> 00:12:18,720
Is that why you need me?

138
00:12:19,200 --> 00:12:20,480
If you don't do that with me...

139
00:12:23,759 --> 00:12:24,759
you'll end up

140
00:12:26,519 --> 00:12:27,600
in agonizing pain.

141
00:12:32,799 --> 00:12:33,879
Your name

142
00:12:36,000 --> 00:12:37,720
means quenching the Li Fire, right?

143
00:12:38,480 --> 00:12:40,200
Have you truly, as the stories say,

144
00:12:41,399 --> 00:12:42,840
been trapped here for 1,000 years?

145
00:12:45,000 --> 00:12:46,519
I was meant to sleep in peace,

146
00:12:46,903 --> 00:12:48,378
waiting for the Cloud Steps to open

147
00:12:48,679 --> 00:12:49,679
to return home.

148
00:12:52,279 --> 00:12:53,339
Yet your blood

149
00:12:54,448 --> 00:12:55,799
dissolved the seal.

150
00:12:56,840 --> 00:12:58,679
So now it's my fault?

151
00:13:03,399 --> 00:13:04,399
Never mind.

152
00:13:05,360 --> 00:13:06,919
I can suppress your Li Fire

153
00:13:08,159 --> 00:13:09,720
because I replaced the seal.

154
00:13:10,639 --> 00:13:11,639
Then when

155
00:13:13,159 --> 00:13:14,440
will the Cloud Steps open?

156
00:13:18,320 --> 00:13:20,679
At midyear,
when the Heavenly Gate opens.

157
00:13:22,000 --> 00:13:23,240
It's only six months away.

158
00:13:24,720 --> 00:13:25,720
Lizhi,

159
00:13:25,960 --> 00:13:26,960
let's make a deal.

160
00:13:28,600 --> 00:13:29,600
You said earlier

161
00:13:29,799 --> 00:13:31,080
you're trapped by the Li Fire.

162
00:13:31,679 --> 00:13:33,039
Now that the seal is broken,

163
00:13:33,919 --> 00:13:34,919
it means

164
00:13:35,320 --> 00:13:36,639
if the Li Fire isn't quenched,

165
00:13:36,639 --> 00:13:38,600
you can't return
even when the Cloud Steps open.

166
00:13:41,279 --> 00:13:42,279
My Lord,

167
00:13:42,679 --> 00:13:44,279
I also have a home to return to,

168
00:13:44,279 --> 00:13:45,519
and you need something from me.

169
00:13:46,559 --> 00:13:47,879
Why don't we strike a deal?

170
00:13:53,080 --> 00:13:54,559
Help me return to the mortal realm

171
00:13:55,039 --> 00:13:56,360
and protect my family.

172
00:13:59,279 --> 00:14:00,679
And I'll suppress your Li Fire

173
00:14:01,840 --> 00:14:03,080
and help you return home.

174
00:14:04,039 --> 00:14:05,360
Once half a year passes

175
00:14:06,000 --> 00:14:07,039
and the Cloud Steps open,

176
00:14:08,240 --> 00:14:09,360
our debts will be settled,

177
00:14:10,639 --> 00:14:11,639
and we'll part ways.

178
00:14:20,320 --> 00:14:23,200
So, you want to go back that badly?

179
00:14:34,759 --> 00:14:35,759
Wangshu,

180
00:14:36,440 --> 00:14:37,919
I know you'll escape.

181
00:14:39,000 --> 00:14:40,519
But why has there been no sign

182
00:14:41,159 --> 00:14:42,759
after all these days?

183
00:14:44,480 --> 00:14:45,480
Wangshu!

184
00:14:46,759 --> 00:14:47,919
Wangshu!

185
00:14:48,600 --> 00:14:51,279
Yue Wangshu, can you hear me?

186
00:14:51,279 --> 00:14:52,879
It's Xingyao.

187
00:14:52,879 --> 00:14:53,879
Wangshu.

188
00:14:55,080 --> 00:14:56,559
Well, well, isn't this Lady Xingyao?

189
00:14:57,679 --> 00:14:59,080
We've finally found you.

190
00:14:59,600 --> 00:15:00,600
Who are you?

191
00:15:00,639 --> 00:15:01,960
We work for Prefect Zhang.

192
00:15:02,240 --> 00:15:05,240
Our young master says
you were betrothed to him long ago,

193
00:15:05,240 --> 00:15:06,720
yet you keep avoiding him.

194
00:15:07,080 --> 00:15:09,440
We have our orders, so come with us.

195
00:15:09,840 --> 00:15:10,840
Nonsense!

196
00:15:10,960 --> 00:15:12,879
My family's main branch
arranged that betrothal.

197
00:15:12,879 --> 00:15:13,879
I never agreed to it.

198
00:15:13,960 --> 00:15:15,879
A parents' command, a matchmaker's word.

199
00:15:16,639 --> 00:15:17,759
Our young master says

200
00:15:18,080 --> 00:15:20,200
since you're betrothed,
you belong to him.

201
00:15:20,360 --> 00:15:21,360
You can't get away.

202
00:15:22,879 --> 00:15:23,879
Stay back!

203
00:15:25,799 --> 00:15:26,799
Don't come any closer!

204
00:15:31,759 --> 00:15:32,759
What's going on?

205
00:15:44,996 --> 00:15:48,598
♪The loong's wrath
shakes mountains and rivers♪

206
00:15:48,919 --> 00:15:49,919
Wangshu!

207
00:15:52,134 --> 00:15:55,269
♪You are a drop of blood upon my heart♪

208
00:15:55,269 --> 00:15:59,020
♪I am a wound etched into your palm♪

209
00:15:59,020 --> 00:16:02,259
♪Cloud steps open,
where does the way home lie♪

210
00:16:02,259 --> 00:16:05,755
♪Scattering my divine soul
to gaze upon you for a lifetime♪

211
00:16:05,755 --> 00:16:08,511
♪Wind and snow bear witness,
this heart was not in vain♪

212
00:16:08,589 --> 00:16:11,296
♪With you here♪

213
00:16:11,296 --> 00:16:17,583
♪Everywhere is my home♪

214
00:16:39,812 --> 00:16:45,417
♪Then they travel
to every corner of the world♪

215
00:16:45,417 --> 00:16:49,983
♪She takes up her brush
to paint his likeness♪
